{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the record when a payload cannot be Jackson-copied**\n\nEvery exporter first converts included payloads through this module's mapper. A value supported by the configured SDK `SerDes` but not this mapper throws before `export`, so every exporter\u2014including custom ones\u2014loses the terminal record. Normalize from configured serialized payloads, or catch conversion per field and omit only unsupported content; add custom-SerDes output/result coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7s0apZ","finding_digest":"01c1b4f157dfa084e51d95d8d2bb26f5f64497be955a6cbb7376f8c701851dbe","finding_id":"arf_v1_aha3j4kx36qijzi5sxmnfozg6x","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::custom-serdes-payload-record-preservation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::custom-serdes-payload-record-preservation","line":221,"observation_digest":"e8ce881fefd79c9671c5ab3d4aaa285faf99994d685d216aa4eb3a14796ef2de","observation_id":"aro_v1_5dhiqh7p26ojm4ofvm6uvkril6","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aha3j4kx36qijzi5sxmnfozg6x","published_at":"2026-09-09T21:25:56Z","review_id":"arr_v1_scztmzrchxwvclkurodp4sbyjj","reviewed_base_sha":"479f023a672bf03f84703cde341df7b48c8eb72a","reviewed_head_sha":"7f3bdc4e67fc71884846370ed3fa3b98f5eb4842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":221,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_mahqrid4n6lsgpxb2qefqlzcm4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T21:25:56Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
